Zapping at a wall is NOT the way to ID a wand.  One way to
start is Engrave one letter with it.  That will ID over half
of the wand types if you know what each message means.

> and it turns out to be a wand of fire, the fire ray bounces.
> DYWYPI? Is there a way not to have this effect?

If you must zap an unIDed wand, do it in combat, and do it
diagonally.  BEAM type wands will send a beam that bounces,
and it will bounce around a lot and have less chance of
hitting you.  DIRECT type wands will send a beam that does
not bounce and they won't be a problem.

